Recommends: homelab-api, homelab-agent
Description: Internal AI service for the homelab-* ecosystem
 The one place in the fleet that talks to Anthropic. Apps POST a Messages
 API request to /internal/v1/ai/messages with their own client token; this
 service adds the API key, pins the API version, enforces a per-client
 daily budget, records every call (client, model, tokens, cache reads,
 latency, status, the consent it was made under) in its own `ai` schema,
 and hands Anthropic's answer back byte for byte (prompt caching is a
 byte-prefix match, so the request is never re-encoded here). Internal
 only: registered in homelab-api's service registry, never given a public
 name. Consent stays with each calling app.
